  "ruleText": "Ed 702.04 Eligibility. The student shall be at least 16 years of age to enroll in an adult high school program.\n\nSource. #2055, eff 6-16-82; ss by #2714, eff 5-16-84; ss by #4851, eff 6-25-90; EXPIRED 6-25-96\n\nNew. #6366, eff 10-30-96, EXPIRED: 10-30-96\n\nNew. #8265, eff 1-22-05; ss by #9638, eff 1-20-10",
